# BAWAAL custom emoji / reactions (LOCKED — exclusive)

The ~106 skeleton PNGs (`assets/skel_*.png`) mapped through **`BawaalEmoji`** are the **official and exclusive** emoji / reaction system for BAWAAL. **Never** revert to unicode / system emoji (🔥 💀 🏆 💬 …) or generic icon packs on chat, banter, DMs, comments, or reaction trays.

## Canonical files

| File | Role |
|---|---|
| `components/BawaalEmoji.js` | `<BawaalEmoji />` + `SKELETON_EMOJIS` (must include `love: require('../assets/skel_love.png')`); Image always has fixed width/height |
| `src/constants/bawaalEmojiAssets.js` | Full map + **`ALL_SKELETON_KEYS`** (must start with `'love'`) |
| `components/FullEmojiPickerDrawer.js` | 106-asset Vault grid — force-includes `love` first |
| `src/utils/bawaalEmojiText.js` | Shortcodes + `BawaalEmojiText` + memoized parse cache |
| `BanterBottomSheet.js` | Banter feed FlatList virtualization |

## Required: `love` (heart-eyed skeleton)

- Asset: `assets/skel_love.png`
- Key: `love` in `SKELETON_EMOJIS` / `BAWAAL_EMOJI_ASSETS`
- Vault: `'love'` in `ALL_SKELETON_KEYS` so it always appears in the modal grid

## Layout (LOCKED)

| Message type | Rule |
|---|---|
| Text + inline emoji | Same **flex row** (`flexDirection: 'row'`, `flexWrap: 'wrap'`, `alignItems: 'center'`). Inline size **~36**. Text must **not** stretch full width. |
| Emoji-only / sticker | Large signature size **~56–64** (`BAWAAL_EMOJI_HERO_SIZE`) |

## Performance (LOCKED)

- `BawaalEmoji` Image: explicit fixed `width` / `height` (no scroll layout shift)
- Shortcode parser: memoized / cached (`parseBawaalEmojiSegments`)
- Banter / chat lists: FlatList with `windowSize={5}`, `maxToRenderPerBatch={10}`, `removeClippedSubviews` (native)

## Never re-add

- System emoji sticker trays · unicode reaction fallbacks · tiny text-height emoji on mixed messages · stacked text-vs-emoji layouts · dropping `love` from the vault · unvirtualized banter ScrollView maps under load
